ons.<SEP>RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) is a method that integrates retrieval mechanisms with generation processes for improved question-answering.<SEP>RAG refers to the standard setting for response generation, where relevant context is retrieved to produce accurate answers to given questions.<SEP>RAG, or Retrieval-Augmented Generation, is a system that utilizes a retriever and a generator to formulate responses based on a given query and corresponding documents."}
