gmented\nlanguage\nmodels,\naddressing\nlimitations\nin\ntraditional\nmethods\nthat\nretrieve\nonly\nshort,\ncontiguous\ntext\nchunks.\nRAPTOR\nforms\na\nsummary\ntree\nto\nretrieve\ninformation\nat\nvarying\nab"}
