al and generation components to produce contextually relevant responses.<SEP>Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) refers to systems that enhance large language models by integrating external knowledge sources for improved response accuracy and relevance to user needs.<SEP>Retrieval-Augmented Generation encompasses current methodologies in AI that combine retrieval techniques with language generation to enhance text-based outputs.<SEP>A method that enhances large language models by incorporating external knowledge bases to improve the relevance and precision of responses."}
